WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.710
I had this meeting with a

00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:05.579
big studio Hollywood&nbsp;casting director.

00:00:05.579 --> 00:00:07.776
and he looked at me and he said,

00:00:07.776 --> 00:00:11.001
"Everybody knows you're a 
beautiful,&nbsp;talented Black girl.

00:00:11.001 --> 00:00:12.628
But what do I do

00:00:12.628 --> 00:00:15.991
with a beautiful, talented Black girl?

00:00:15.991 --> 00:00:19.472
Do I put you in a&nbsp;movie with Tom Cruise?

00:00:19.921 --> 00:00:21.155
Does he kiss you?

00:00:21.155 --> 00:00:22.244
Ugh.

00:00:22.244 --> 00:00:25.398
Who goes to see that movie?"

00:00:25.398 --> 00:00:27.243
He hurt me so deeply,

00:00:27.243 --> 00:00:30.014
I&nbsp;was actually thinking about quitting.

00:00:30.014 --> 00:00:31.780
Until ...

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:34.602
I started to think.

00:00:34.602 --> 00:00:37.396
He said that everybody knew

00:00:37.396 --> 00:00:39.063
that I was a beautiful,

00:00:39.063 --> 00:00:42.169
talented Black girl.

00:00:42.169 --> 00:00:45.401
So what&nbsp;was meant to break 
me did not break me,

00:00:45.401 --> 00:00:46.692
it built me up.

00:00:46.692 --> 00:00:50.063
And I walked out of there giving&nbsp;
myself permission

00:00:50.063 --> 00:00:52.543
to take up space in Hollywood,

00:00:52.543 --> 00:00:54.211
knowing that I belonged there

00:00:54.211 --> 00:00:58.975
no&nbsp;matter what anybody
 thought about me.

